        {
          "name": "Params",
          "type": "FCollisionQueryParams&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Response Params",
          "type": "FCollisionResponseParams&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Object Params",
          "type": "FCollisionObjectQueryParams&",
          "default": "FCollisionObjectQueryParams::DefaultObjectQueryParam"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Trace a ray against the world and return touching hits and then first blocking hit\nResults are sorted, so a blocking hit (if found) will be the last element of the array\nOnly the single closest blocking result will be generated, no tests will be done after that"
    },
