          "default": "FCollisionObjectQueryParams::DefaultObjectQueryParam"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "INTERNAL USE ONLY\nPhysics thread sphere query:\nTrace a sphere against the world and return touching hits and then first blocking hit\nResults are sorted, so a blocking hit (if found) will be the last element of the array\nOnly the single closest blocking result will be generated, no tests will be done after that.\nFalls back to a raycast is the query radius is less than or equal to zero."
